 "updated": "23 Nov 2026",
 "headline": "Kog'Maw, Annie and Ekko lead patch 26.23",
 "lede": "<b>35 of the 65</b> most-picked champions (5% or more of their role's games) win less than half of them. OP.GG read five and a half days into the patch, <b>about a million Emerald+ games</b>, plus four more stat sites at Diamond+ from day two, corrected for small samples and one-tricks.",
 "takes": {
  "top": "Kayle and Singed are the outliers, both at +2.0, and Kled is the only other S. Singed and Shen lead Diamond+, and no top laner is S in Master+, where Camille and Urgot lead at +1.1. K'Sante got buffed and gained the most since last patch, but he still loses more than any popular top laner, and Jayce and Yone are picked a lot and lose too.",
  "jungle": "Zyra and Lillia lead Emerald+ at +2.0, with Rek'Sai and Wukong the other S picks, and no jungler is an outlier there. Nidalee is the outlier in Diamond+, and Nidalee and Zyra in Master+. Master Yi dropped the most after his nerf, and Lee Sin (13% of games) and Qiyana still lose.",
  "mid": "Annie, Ekko and Vex are all outliers, the only role with three. Katarina leads Diamond+, and Katarina and Zoe are the outliers in Master+. Most of this patch's changes hit mid: Mel, Galio and Annie gained the most since last patch, Syndra and LeBlanc dropped, and Viktor, Akali and Syndra are each in about 8% of games and lose.",
  "adc": "Kog'Maw is the outlier at every rank, at +2.7 in Emerald+, and Xayah is the only other S there. Ezreal got buffed and went from 15% to 20% pick, and he still has the worst score of any popular ADC.",
  "support": "No support is an outlier. Taric, Zilean, Rell and Sona are the S picks in Emerald+, with Braum, Leona, Rakan and Janna right behind, so pick what fits your bot laner. Janna, Braum and Rakan lead Diamond+, Rell leads Master+. Yuumi, Karma and Lux are popular and lose, and Bard moved up to C after his Q buff, still below average."
 },
